OL,3,AFighting returns to Kherson region
OL,4,Aafter longest Ukraine war ceasefire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFighting has resumed in Ukraine's
OL,7,FKherson after a six-day truce brought
OL,8,Fquiet to the front-line region for the
OL,9,Ffirst time in years.
OL,11,FThe ceasefire - the longest since the
OL,12,Fstart of Russia's full-scale invasion
OL,13,Fin 2022 - allowed hundreds of people
OL,14,Ftrapped in the Russian-occupied
OL,15,FUkrainian town of Oleshky and its
OL,16,Fsurroundings to be evacuated.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,316,300,200,140,0,100
